        "table": null,
        "text": "Research and development expenses increased $11.8 billion from 2024 to 2025, primarily driven by increases in employee compensation expenses of $6.9 billion and depreciation expense of $2.4 billion. The increase in employee compensation expenses was primarily driven by an increase in SBC expenses of $4.2 billion, which included an increase in a valuation-based compensation charge related to Waymo.",
